    "notes": "DO NOT TRANSLATE, NOT CURRENTLY USED Reference to Guile from Street Fighter-series",
    "value": ""You'll be home with your family in a flash."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_jackhammer_slower_winddown",
