    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_04",
    "value": "Armadura templada",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_04_desc",
    "value": ""Templada diferencialmente siguiendo una técnica tradicional europea."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_05",
    "value": "Armadura famosa",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_05_desc",
    "notes": "From lyrics to song Fame from movie Fame",
    "value": ""Una gran armadura conlleva una gran responsabilidad."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_06",
    "value": "Armadura Doom",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_06_desc",
    "notes": "From Doom game manual description of their armor and pun on title "knee-deep in the dead" – the first level from original Doom",
    "value": ""Una armadura defensiva común, diseñada para cuando estás con el agua hasta el cuello."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_07",
    "value": "Armadura de luna llena",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_07_desc",
    "notes": "Reference to Tom Petty's song "Won't back down" from album "Full Moon Fever"",
    "value": ""Tranquilo, no se convertirá en una piel de lobo en noches de luna llena."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_08",
    "value": "Armadura del fénix",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_08_desc",
    "notes": "Thou – old english",
    "value": ""Resucitad, quitaos las cenizas del cuerpo y convertíos en una nueva estrella."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_reduce_falldamage_01",
    "notes": " Landing soft like the cougar feline",
    "value": "Garras de puma",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_reduce_falldamage_01_desc",
    "value": "Reduce el daño al caer.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_reduce_falldamage_01_flavor",
    "value": ""Si caigo, atrápame en tus brazos."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_thorns",
    "value": "Placas del karma",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_thorns_desc",
    "value": "Inflige daños a quienes te dañen al tocarte.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_thorns_flavor",
    "notes": "A power ballad song by band Poison",
    "value": ""Tiene espinas el rosal."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_guts",
    "notes": "A spoof on Hasselhoff's song True Survivor for short film Kung Fury",
    "value": "Verdadero superviviente",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_guts_desc",
    "value": "Recupera toda la barra de salud tras recibir daño letal. Un solo uso por recarga. Para recargarlo, visita la ciudad.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_guts_flavor",
    "value": ""Resurge de entre las cenizas como el único sobreviviente."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_resistliquids",
    "notes": "Vidar = The Norse God that slayed the Fenrir Wolf",
    "value": "Botas de Vidar",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_resistliquids_desc",
    "value": "Te vuelven invulnerable al ácido y a la lava durante un breve periodo de tiempo.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_resistliquids_flavor",
    "value": ""Con estás botas no caminarás sobre el agua, pero sí sobre la lava y el fuego."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_damage_reduction",
    "value": "Armadura de ultra compuestos",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_damage_reduction_desc",
    "value": "Reduce el daño que recibes.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_damage_reduction_flavor",
    "value": ""Una muestra de la protección más resistente jamás creada."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_rainbow_orbs",
    "notes": "*NEW* Song "As long as you love me" by Backstreet Boys. I don't care who you are, Where you're from, What you did, As long as you love me. The terms diversity, fluid and rainbow are used as an hommage to tolerance and the LGBTQ community.",
    "value": "Diversidad nuclear",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_rainbow_orbs_desc",
    "value": "Una armadura líquida policromática que te da una pequeña oportunidad de obtener 3 orbes de arco iris cuando derrotas a un enemigo.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_rainbow_orbs_flavor",
    "value": ""¿A quién le importa lo que yo haga? ¿A quién le importa lo que yo diga? Yo soy así, así vestiré, nunca cambiaré."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_deflect",
    "value": "Armadura de aramida",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_deflect_desc",
    "value": "Rechaza el primer proyectil que te golpee. Se recarga tras 30 segundos.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_armor_deflect_flavor",
    "notes": "A riposte used when someone calls you a name. Indicates that whatever ... I'm rubber you're glue, your words bounce off me and stick to you. Also a nod to its usage in Monkey Island game series.",
    "value": ""Rebota, rebota y en tu cara explota."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank",
    "value": "Tanque de agua",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_desc",
    "value": "Muchas de las herramientas necesitan agua. La puedes reponer en los manantiales que se encuentran en las minas.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_next_level_desc",
    "value": "Mejora tu tanque de agua para aumentar tu reserva total de agua.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_01",
    "value": "Jarra simple",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_01_desc",
    "value": ""Es la piedra angular de la tecnología de vapor."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_02",
    "notes": "Herman Melville - author of Moby Dick",
    "value": "Regulador Melville",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_02_desc",
    "value": ""Dale un toque clásico a tu tecnología acuática."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_03",
    "notes": "The Notourious B.I.G. and his song Mo money Mo problems",
    "value": "Mojada Rodríguez",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_03_desc",
    "value": ""Y si ya tengo el agua que me da la lluvia."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_04",
    "notes": "Old band The Sisters of Mercy",
    "value": "Las cisternas muertas",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_04_desc",
    "notes": "One of their songs",
    "value": ""Agüita amarilla."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_05",
    "notes": "From Captain Nemo's submarine Nautilus",
    "value": "Nautilus II",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_05_desc",
    "notes": "Spoof on Jules Verne's book Twenty Thousand Leagues under the sea",
    "value": ""Veinte mil leguas de agua submarina."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_water_pickup_01",
    "value": "Invocalluvias",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_water_pickup_01_desc",
    "notes": " new: minor rephrasing.",
    "value": "Probabilidad de que los enemigos derrotados produzcan un orbe de agua adicional.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_water_pickup_01_flavor",
    "notes": "BJ Thomas song Raindrops Keep falling on my head",
    "value": ""Llueve sobre mojado."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_improved_water_pump",
    "notes": "Technotronics old song",
    "value": "Chorreo estéreo",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_improved_water_pump_desc",
    "value": "Absorbe agua más rápido de los depósitos.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_improved_water_pump_flavor",
    "notes": "From the song Pump up the Jam",
    "value": ""De la absorción de agua ligera, nada nos libre, agua más llega."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_water_condenser",
    "value": "Vaporizador de humedad",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_water_condenser_desc",
    "value": "Transforma el vapor en agua corriente.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_water_condenser_flavor",
    "notes": "Jimmy cliff song lyrics: I can see clearly now the rain is gone",
    "value": ""Ojalá llueva vapor en las minas."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_light_orbs_to_water",
    "value": "Cazatormentas",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_light_orbs_to_water_desc",
    "value": "Este chisme condensador convierte los orbes de luz en orbes de agua. No afecta a los orbes arco iris.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_light_orbs_to_water_flavor",
    "notes": "Reference to the Bible where Jesus turned water into wine",
    "value": ""La luz en agua, el agua en vino: es el truco más antiguo de todos."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_regeneration",
    "value": "Regeneración acuática",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_regeneration_desc",
    "notes": " new: minor rephrasing",
    "value": "Recupera tu salud cuando estás en fuentes de agua.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_watertank_regeneration_flavor",
    "value": ""El ciclo del agua y el de la vida son uno."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap",
    "value": "Mapa",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_desc",
    "value": "Te muestra dónde has estado y a dónde vas.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_01",
    "value": "Mapa",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_01_desc",
    "notes": "Quote from Earl Nightingale, american writer",
    "value": ""Todo lo que necesitas es un plan, un mapa y la valentía necesaria para lanzarte hacia tu próximo destino."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_quest_pointer",
    "notes": " (Renamed)",
    "value": "Marcadores de mapa",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_quest_pointer_desc",
    "notes": " Text within { } should not be translated.",
    "value": "Muestra los marcadores ({image quest_pointer_arrow} y {image quest_pointer_crosshair}) en el mapa hacia tu destino de misión.

{format bold}Si prefieres explorar sin ayuda, desactiva este engranaje modificador.{format reset}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_quest_pointer_flavor",
    "notes": "A nod to Lemmy's Show and the character Falconhoof. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oWmiShFb0go",
    "value": ""Atención en carretera, le atiende Belén, ¿en qué puedo ayudarle?"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_mineral_detector",
    "notes": "Nod to the Harry Potter Marauder's Map",
    "value": "Mapa del acaparador",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_mineral_detector_desc",
    "value": "Muestra todos los minerales en el minimapa.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_mineral_detector_flavor",
    "notes": "Small pun on actor Roger Moore",
    "value": ""¡Mineralízate!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_hp_bar",
    "notes": " Odin – all-seeing father of norse mythology, quote is merely a question without reference, feel free to make it into your own languages equivalent",
    "value": "Ojo de Odín",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_hp_bar_desc",
    "value": "Muestra la salud de los enemigos cuando sufren algún daño.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_minimap_hp_bar_flavor",
    "value": ""¿Qué hay más allá de lo que los ojos ven?"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_run_boots",
    "notes": "*DEMO*",
    "value": "Esprint hidráulico",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_run_boots_desc",
    "value": "Mantén {indicator run} para correr.
Si corres, te mueves más rápido y saltas más alto.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_run_boots_flavor",
    "notes": "I Blame Coco lyrics from song Quicker",
    "value": ""¡Sé más rápido que King África en un buffet libre!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_buddy",
    "notes": "Name",
    "value": "Fen",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_buddy_desc",
    "value": "Un ser fantasmagórico misterioso que ha convertido la caldera de vapor en su hogar.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate",
    "value": "Motor del Destino",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_desc",
    "value": "Mejoras misteriosas que cambian los engranajes del universo.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_flavor",
    "notes": "Black Sabbath lyrics from song Symptom of the universe",
    "value": ""Llevas el destino del universo escrito en tu mirada."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_bloodquest",
    "value": "{image danger}Misión de sangre{image danger}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_bloodquest_desc",
    "notes": "Blood Stone is a resource in the game. Text within { } should not be translated. ",
    "value": "¡Derrama sangre para ganar recompensas!
Duplica las posibilidades de obtener piedras de sangre cuando los enemigos mueren, pero también duplica el daño que te causan.

{format bold}Activar este engranaje modificador hará tu misión mucho más difícil. Solo se recomienda para veteranos.{format reset}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_bloodquest_flavor",
    "value": ""Un arma de doble filo."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_xpx2",
    "value": "{image danger}El Libro de los aventureros{image danger}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_xpx2_desc",
    "notes": "Text within { } should not be translated. ",
    "value": "Obtén el doble de XP con cada muerte, pero los enemigos solo te darán orbes por muertes creativas o bonificaciones.

{format bold}Activar este engranaje modificador hará tus misiones mucho más difíciles. Recomendado solo para veteranos.{format reset}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_xpx2_flavor",
    "notes": "Made up proverb",
    "value": ""El que no sufre, no avanza."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_explosions",
    "value": "{image danger}Explosión mortis{image danger}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_explosions_desc",
    "notes": "Text within { } should not be translated. ",
    "value": "Los enemigos explotan al morir.

{format bold}Activar este engranaje modificador hará tus misiones mucho más difíciles.{format reset}",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_explosions_flavor",
    "notes": "Let there be light, from the bible",
    "value": ""¡Hágase la explosión!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_resource_exploder",
    "notes": " Criss-Cross is refering to that the adjacent tiles will break in a cross pattern. Totally krossed out is Rap duo Kriss-Kross debut album, so it's a pun on that, but with correct spelling with c, not k.",
    "value": "Combustión cruzada",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_resource_exploder_desc",
    "value": "Destruir un mosaico de recursos produce una pequeña explosión que daña los mosaicos adyacentes.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_resource_exploder_flavor",
    "value": ""La que has liado, pollito."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_hell_cave_sigil",
    "notes": " Latin for Seal of Heaven and Hell",
    "value": "Sigillum Caelum et Infernum",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_hell_cave_sigil_desc",
    "value": "En la solitaria cima del tiempo
un aullido recorre el desierto
alcanza los cielos para sellar tu destino
en un lugar extraño, vacío, divino.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_fate_hell_cave_sigil_flavor",
    "notes": " Nod to Twin Peaks: Fire Walk With Me, meaning that you invite the devil to join you. Fate walk with me implies that you invite fate into your life.",
    "value": ""Destino, camina conmigo."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack",
    "value": "Motor de reacción",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_desc",
    "value": "Mantén {indicator jump} para volar.
Este motor de combustión diésel experimental se puede usar sin utilizar agua, pero se sobrecalienta rápidamente.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_next_level_desc",
    "value": "Mejora el motor de reacción para que dure más.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_01",
    "notes": "From Rocketeer comic origin 1939, character Cliff Secord",
    "value": "Propulsor diésel",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_01_desc",
    "value": ""Un motor básico de cuatro cilindros en línea."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_02",
    "value": "Ciclón doble",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_02_desc",
    "value": ""Invertido y con aire acondicionado."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_03",
    "notes": "Reference to a French WW1 engine.",
    "value": "Le Rhône 69",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_03_desc",
    "value": ""Tiene un sistema de enfriamiento de agua y aire. Es todo o nada, nena, ¡todo o nada!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_slayer",
    "value": "Estatoreactor Vigor",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_slayer_desc",
    "value": "Cuando usas la explosión de tu propulsor, destruirás a todos los enemigos y mosaicos débiles que te toquen.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_slayer_flavor",
    "notes": "Reference to Eric Clapton song Grand Illusion",
    "value": ""Atrapado entre la locura y el fuego."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_feather_fall",
    "notes": " References is to song Falling by Julee Cruise, and song line Don't let yourself be hurt this time.",
    "value": "Control de crucero",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_feather_fall_desc",
    "value": "Cuando el propulsor se sobrecaliente, mantén {indicator jump} para reducir la velocidad de caída.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_feather_fall_flavor",
    "value": ""No dejes que nada te dañe esta vez."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_boost",
    "notes": " Quote from character Maverick from movie Top Gun. Maverick Afterburner is also a reference to the character played by Tom Cruise.",
    "value": "Postquemador rebelde",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_boost_desc",
    "value": "Aumenta la velocidad de tu propulsor. ¡Pon tu motor a todo gas y escucha cómo ruge!",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_boost_flavor",
    "value": ""Siento la necesidad de la velocidad."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_in_air_cooling",
    "notes": "*NEW* Eastbound and down is a song from the movie "Smokey and the Bandit" Cletus Snow is a character from the movie, and his dog's name is Fred.",
    "value": "Enfriamiento por aire",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_in_air_cooling_desc",
    "value": "Suelta {indicator jump} en el aire para enfriar tu propulsor. Fabricado por Jon y Nieve y Cía.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_steampack_in_air_cooling_flavor",
    "value": ""¡Ve al infinito y más allá sin sobrecalentarte!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb",
    "value": "Bomba de presión",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_desc",
    "value": "La puedes lanzar hacia el frente, arriba o abajo. Consume agua.
¡Pulsa {indicator tool_pressurebomb} para lanzarla!",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_next_level_desc",
    "value": "Mejora tus bombas de presión para poder lanzarlas más lejos.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_01",
    "notes": "Osmotic= water pressure terminology",
    "value": "Bomba de presión osmótica",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_01_desc",
    "notes": "A small refernence, mid-range migraine, to song The Message by Grandmaster Flash and the Furious Five",
    "value": ""La alta presión implica una gran explosión -y un gran dolor de cabeza- a media distancia."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_02",
    "notes": "Per Scholander= physiologist renowned for pressure bomb technology",
    "value": "Bomba hidrostática Scholander",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_02_desc",
    "value": ""¡Lanza la destrucción presurizada aún más lejos!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_03",
    "value": "Bomba ácida",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_03_desc",
    "notes": "Reference to Scooter song Acid Bomb",
    "value": ""Para matar, esto es una bomba, para cavar, esto es una bomba."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_04",
    "notes": "*NEW* Reference: Song Who Put The Bomp by Barry Mann: "Who put the bomp in the bomp bah bomp bah bomp / Who put the ram in the rama lama ding dong / Who put the bop in the bop shoo bop shoo bop / Who put the dip in the dip da dip da dip." =So now you can throw the bomb further = bomb bah LONGA' =longer",
    "value": "Bombaleo",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_04_desc",
    "value": ""¡Bombaleo, bombalea, porque mi vida yo la prefiero vivir así, lanzando bombas hasta morir!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_brickbreaker",
    "value": "Proyectiles antibúnker",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_brickbreaker_desc",
    "value": "¡Otorga penetración a tus bombas de presión para que puedas romper rocas aún más resistentes!",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_pressurebomb_brickbreaker_flavor",
    "notes": "Ghostbusters pun - When there's something strange in the neighbourhood, who ya gonna call",
