  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_03_desc",
    "value": ""Так и есть. Честно."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_04",
    "notes": " Pun on the lost epic of ancient Greek litterature, The Sack of Troy",
    "value": "Троянский мешок",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_04_desc",
    "notes": " Pun on Achillean heel,expression meaning where your weakness is",
    "value": ""Да в него коня поместить можно."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_05",
    "notes": "Pun on the old "I can't believe it's not butter" https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Can%27t_Believe_It%27s_Not_Butter!",
    "value": "Сумка. Сделано с умом!",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_05_desc",
    "notes": "When re-released the product had an additional line on the package - Good on everything.",
    "value": ""Места хватит на все!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_06",
    "value": "Переноска для гремлина",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_06_desc",
    "notes": " A pun on the creatures Gremlins from movie Gremlins. They get evil if they eat after midnight.",
    "value": ""Не кормите после полуночи!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_07",
    "notes": "Elves like Legolas from Lord of The rings",
    "value": "Эльфийская торба",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_07_desc",
    "notes": "Pun on Legolas quote: let a ploughman plough, but choose an otter for swimming, and for running light over grass and leaf, or over snow--an Elf.",
    "value": ""Пахарь хорош в поле, выдра - в воде, а для ходьбы по траве, листьям и снегу нужна сумка!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_08",
    "notes": "Lord of the Rings pun - One ring to tame them all.",
    "value": "Одна на все - и все в одну!",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_08_desc",
    "value": ""Шутка, повторенная дважды, становится понятней. Но сумка-то хорошая. Честное слово."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_09",
    "notes": " The big and extinct Elephant-like creature.",
    "value": "Мамонтовая сумка",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_09_desc",
    "value": ""Большая и мохнатая."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_10",
    "notes": "Pun on the Hindu Scripture Bhagavad Gita https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhagavad_Gita",
    "value": "Сума сумоиста",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_10_desc",
    "notes": "sanskrit vedanta – vedan't ya? Hinduism - Hindsight",
    "value": ""Послушай восточную мудрость. Наполни эту суму радостью жизни! Большим людям - большие сумки."",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_magnetic_pull_01",
    "value": "Магнит-сепаратор",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_magnetic_pull_01_desc",
    "notes": " new: minor rephrasing",
    "value": "Притягивает к вам открытые ресурсы.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_magnetic_pull_01_flavor",
    "notes": "Harry Potter pun on spell accio = fetch",
    "value": ""Акцио все - и побольше!"",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_extra_ore_01",
    "notes": " Norse God Freyr owned a ship that he could fold into his pocket when not needed",
    "value": "Карман Фрейра",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_extra_ore_01_desc",
    "value": "По дополнительному куску руды в каждую ячейку.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_extra_ore_01_flavor",
    "notes": " Taken from norse mythology, The books of Snorri, The prose Edda, The poetic Edda.",
    "value": ""Прозаично, поэтично, прелестно."",
