    "notes": "Famous Internet meme Double Rainbow https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OQSNhk5ICTI",
    "value": "Двойная радуга",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_double_resources_desc",
    "notes": "new: minor rephrasing",
    "value": "Шанс получить два ресурса с одной плитки.",
  },
  {
    "key": "upgrades.upgrade_backpack_double_resources_flavor",
